```
(b) 검증:
```powershell
& "C:\Users\mrblue\Claude\morning breifing_code\scripts\run-py.ps1" -Script check_subject.py -Args @('--file','C:\Users\mrblue\AppData\Local\Temp\morning-briefing\subject.txt')
